下面这份池实现在连续取还 100 次后出现“幽灵命中”和野指针崩溃。指出至少三处问题并写出修正：

APooledBullet* UBulletPool::Acquire()
{
    if (FreeList.Num() > 0)
    {
        APooledBullet* Bullet = FreeList[0];
        FreeList.RemoveAt(0);
        return Bullet;
    }
    return nullptr;
}

void APooledBullet::Deactivate()
{
    SetActorHiddenInGame(true);
}

